              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm m-0">
                Peak output lasts a short time and is far more than you need a metre from your face. Compare headlamps on battery type, the medium-mode runtime and the quality of the low mode, which is where you will spend most of an evening.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-100 rounded-2xl p-6">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-red-900 mt-0 mb-2">Storing alkaline batteries inside the lamp</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm m-0">
                Alkaline AAA cells left in a headlamp for a year can leak and corrode the contacts. Store them outside the lamp or use lithium AAA cells, which resist leaking and hold their charge far longer, and date the pack.
              </p>
