              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">What is the best headlamp for power outages?</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                The Petzl ACTIK CORE is the best all-round choice because it runs on its rechargeable pack or on three AAA batteries. You charge it like a phone day to day, and if an outage outlasts your power bank, a pack of AAAs keeps it working. It is bright enough for every indoor job.
