            <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-100">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Is a rechargeable or AAA headlamp better?</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                Rechargeable is better for everyday use because you never buy batteries. AAA is better for long outages because batteries store for years and are easy to buy. A hybrid headlamp that accepts both gives you the advantages of each, which is why we rank one first.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-100">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">How many lumens do I need in a headlamp?</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                For close work, cooking and reading, 50 to 150 lumens is enough. For walking around, 100 to 300 is plenty. Only searching at distance or fast movement outdoors needs more than 400. Most of the time you will use a low setting, which saves the battery.
              </p>
