              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                Red light preserves your night vision, so you can still see by moonlight when you switch the lamp off, and it does not dazzle the people around you. In an outage it is useful for checking on sleeping children or talking face to face without blinding anyone.
              </p>
